      "id": "yeats-collected-poems-s0208-p00439",
      "source_en": "And God-appointed Berkeley that proved all things a dream,\nThat this pragmatical, preposterous pig of a world, its farrow\nthat so solid seem,\nMust vanish on the instant if the mind but change its theme;",
